WEBVTT

00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:04.990
Okita-kun!

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:10.900
<b>Touken Ranbu </b>Hanamaru<b></b>

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:14.080
Damn, Yamatonokami is late.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:17.540
Could he just be hiding somewhere,
 so he won't be spotted?

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:19.690
Can he not find an escape route?

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:21.900
What's wrong?

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:23.230
Is this worrying you?

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:25.070
I'm not sure.

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:38.050
Drink, drink, drink up the
sake, the more you drink,

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:42.180
the more you'll become the best...

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:44.420
...spear in Japan!

00:00:44.890 --> 00:00:50.400
Drink until you can't drink anymore...

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:57.880
Now this is a true Kuroda warrior!

00:00:57.880 --> 00:00:59.060
That was great!

00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:02.030
Okay, the Shinsengumi swords 
will be singing next!

00:01:02.310 --> 00:01:06.270
They're in the middle of 
a mission at the Ikeda Inn.

00:01:06.270 --> 00:01:08.080
Oh, that's right.

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:09.760
Aren't they late getting back?

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:12.210
I'll sing next, then!

00:01:12.650 --> 00:01:14.810
Please do, Otegine-chan!

00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:17.820
If you get doublets, I'll 
treat you to a drink.

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:20.000
If you don't, you're paying for yourself!

00:01:27.390 --> 00:01:31.980
Ah, I'd like to play outside with Master.

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:34.180
Let's try and invite them.

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:36.630
Just because you say you won't go outside

00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:39.240
doesn't mean you should spend 
all day in your sleepwear.

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:41.840
At least wear this, please.

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:43.200
I spent all night sewing it...

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.160
Hasebe-san is working, 
so we shouldn't disturb him.

00:01:49.550 --> 00:01:54.050
I-I wish I could be the Master's assistant.

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:00.680
Huh?

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:02.660
Wh-What's the matter?

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:05.350
Something's off.

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:08.770
Y-Yamatonokami-san...

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:11.460
He's disappeared!

00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:13.690
You're right!

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:15.290
What do this mean?

00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:17.400
Here too, and it's only Yamatonokami.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:21.370
My, my, what in the world could this mean?

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:24.790
You don't think something happened, do you?

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:28.330
It's okay. I'm sure it's just
 a prank by someone.

00:02:28.330 --> 00:02:29.580
A prank?

00:02:29.970 --> 00:02:34.220
I'm sure someone here in the citadel 
could have come up with this prank.

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:36.780
If it's a prank, they've gone too far.

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:40.820
I-Is it really a prank?

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:42.510
Who would do this?

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:43.760
Let's ask around.

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:44.840
Let's go.

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:45.880
Let's do that.

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:50.090
<i>At least, I </i>hope<i> it's just a prank.</i>

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:54.240
Me?

00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:57.490
I swear on my old man, I didn't do it!

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:02.320
Besides, how do you only erase 
Yamatonokami from a picture?

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:05.950
Who let Yamanbagiri drink sake?!

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:11.090
Ah! Your cloth is going to get dirty 
if you roll around there like that!

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:16.710
<b>Sake</b>

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:13.540
I am a copy.

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:15.790
It's fine if I get dirty.

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:17.420
What are you saying?

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:19.030
Please don't move anymore!

00:03:19.030 --> 00:03:20.470
You're making me want to wash it.

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:24.390
I'm begging you, please stop!

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:29.730
<b>Authentic</b>

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:29.730
Hachisuka-niichan, look at this!

00:03:31.930 --> 00:03:36.480
Yes, the shining ocean really 
suits you, Urashima.

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:38.410
As expected of an authentic Kotetsu.

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:39.400
Not that!

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:40.620
Didn't you notice?!

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:42.100
He's not there!

00:03:42.890 --> 00:03:44.230
Not there?

00:03:44.230 --> 00:03:45.770
Who do you mean?

00:03:46.900 --> 00:03:48.620
Kamekichi!

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:50.740
You wanted to be in the photo 
too, right, Kamekichi?

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:55.220
I see, I see. Then we'll all take 
a picture together next time.

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:55.920
That's not exactly what I meant...

00:03:57.090 --> 00:04:00.790
I swear on Aizen Myouou that 
I didn't do this prank.

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:04.080
How do you restore something like this?

00:04:04.080 --> 00:04:07.100
Um, what about you, Akashi-san?

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:10.100
You think I'd go to all that trouble?

00:04:12.740 --> 00:04:15.040
And here, he's not in this one, either.

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:18.110
Is this really someone playing a prank?

00:04:20.050 --> 00:04:21.570
Or...

00:04:22.810 --> 00:04:24.330
Or?

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:26.810
Never mind.

00:04:28.130 --> 00:04:33.260
I'll be able to eat Castella cake with 
Yamatonokami-san again, won't I?

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:37.020
Of course.

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:39.200
Don't worry, everything will be all right.

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:42.490
Okay!

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:50.130
Roar, my muscles!

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:52.820
E-Excuse me.

00:04:53.570 --> 00:04:56.110
I was hoping you could look at this picture.

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:59.060
Ah, you are amazing, Doudanuki Masakuni.

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:02.980
You're splendid from your pectoralis
major to serratus anterior.

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:07.650
I don't get what you're saying, 
but that's fine if I'm getting stronger.

00:05:07.650 --> 00:05:11.940
My trapezius muscles seem to have
become more powerful as well.

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:22.450
He's not there, is he?

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:25.550
Yes. He's not in any of these.

00:05:26.140 --> 00:05:29.180
Do you have any ideas?

00:05:36.590 --> 00:05:38.810
We... don't....

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:43.310
<i>Well, okay...</i>

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:49.750
More importantly, look at this.

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:51.360
It broke, and it won't stop.

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:54.370
<b>Ha ha ha</b>

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:57.360
<b>Ha ha ha</b>

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:06.370
<b>Ha ha ha</b>

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:17.630
<b>Ha ha ha</b>

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:14.840
Namazuo-niisan?

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:18.360
Honebami-niisan, please save me!

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:24.760
It's all bubbly!

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:29.190
So, how did you erase only 
Yamatonokami from the pictures?

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:34.690
I didn't do it.

00:06:36.650 --> 00:06:39.660
You can't help but suspect 
Tsuru-san, can you?

00:06:39.660 --> 00:06:42.910
Hey now, Mitsubou, don't be rude.

00:06:42.910 --> 00:06:46.630
This just means that the least
 likely person is the culprit.

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:51.460
Who would be the least likely 
to play a prank on Yamatonokami?

00:06:58.290 --> 00:07:00.360
I have no intention of getting along.

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:03.710
Kara-chan.

00:07:12.180 --> 00:07:14.820
What a strange thing to have happened.

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:17.130
Yeah, you're right.

00:07:17.130 --> 00:07:19.800
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:21.990
What do you think?

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:23.750
This...

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:27.760
probably means that something 
is happening at the Ikeda Inn.

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:29.720
What could it be?

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:31.430
Yamatonokami.

00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:35.400
If he were to try and alter history...

00:07:36.110 --> 00:07:38.070
Alter history?

00:07:38.070 --> 00:07:39.500
What would happen if he did?

00:07:39.820 --> 00:07:42.870
A new assassin would appear.

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:46.260
Though I hope my suspicions are wrong.

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:48.730
Yamatonokami-san...

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:52.020
There's no need to worry.

00:07:52.020 --> 00:07:55.070
The Shinsengumi swords have a strong bond.

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:56.370
That's right!

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:58.700
Whatever happens, Kashuu-san is there.

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:00.000
That's right.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.310
Kashuu-dono will take care of it.

00:08:02.310 --> 00:08:05.090
He is the most veteran 
member of this citadel.

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:07.790
We can depend on Kashuu-san.

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:13.230
Let's pray for their safety.

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:38.280
Souji!

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:39.750
Okita-kun!

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.380
S-Souji!

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:12.190
Okita-kun!

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:13.900
Don't!

00:09:19.550 --> 00:09:22.580
What are you doing?

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:27.530
Don't make excuses for not 
doing what you must.

00:09:28.140 --> 00:09:29.440
It's annoying.

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:32.440
Draw your sword!

00:09:39.990 --> 00:09:42.100
Isn't he way too late at this point?

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:49.550
Enemies we've never seen before?

00:09:49.550 --> 00:09:51.770
The Kebiishi?

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:53.450
Kebiishi?

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:58.290
They appear whenever they sense 
someone severely meddling with history.

00:09:58.640 --> 00:10:00.660
Why are they here?

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:03.190
Their bloodlust is impressive.

00:10:03.190 --> 00:10:05.120
How strong are they?

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:08.080
About my level?

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:09.540
Oh?

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:35.150
Out of bullets.

00:10:38.190 --> 00:10:39.870
Kashuu!

00:10:41.920 --> 00:10:42.910
Kane-san!

00:10:44.680 --> 00:10:46.590
Move, Kunihiro!

00:10:46.890 --> 00:10:47.940
I'm sorry.

00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:49.780
Why are you apologizing?

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:51.470
Kashuu!

00:10:51.470 --> 00:10:53.410
Leave this to us!

00:10:53.740 --> 00:10:56.350
We won't let them set foot in the Ikeda Inn!

00:10:56.350 --> 00:10:57.380
Thanks!

00:10:58.960 --> 00:11:01.410
<i>Take care of Yamatonokami.</i>

00:11:06.620 --> 00:11:07.720
Kane-san!

00:11:08.610 --> 00:11:10.050
Get up, Kane-san!

00:11:10.050 --> 00:11:13.000
You're the cool and strong sword, aren't you?!

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:15.290
You said it's stupid to just
 focus on appearances!

00:11:15.290 --> 00:11:18.590
Weren't we always going to fight together?

00:11:18.590 --> 00:11:20.770
Without you, Kane-san, I can't—

00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:31.250
Kunihiro.

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:36.250
Don't go acting like I'm dead.

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:37.950
Kane-san!

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:41.960
I can't just leave you alone, can I?

00:11:58.120 --> 00:12:00.700
You're pretty good, y'know.

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:05.730
I'm pretty sturdy, despite being a fake.

00:12:05.730 --> 00:12:08.780
Besides, my little brothers 
are waiting for me.

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:12.720
Take that!

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:43.630
You've got people waiting for you, don't ya?

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:45.240
Get it together.

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:47.850
I'm not done yet.

00:13:15.430 --> 00:13:17.060
What the hell are you doing?!

00:13:18.590 --> 00:13:21.010
Kiyo... mitsu...

00:13:22.450 --> 00:13:23.350
I—

00:13:24.720 --> 00:13:26.220
Look into my eyes!

00:13:26.850 --> 00:13:29.340
Your master right now isn't Okita-kun!

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:44.450
I wanted to protect Okita-kun, too.

00:13:45.390 --> 00:13:47.630
I wanted to fight with him, 
unbroken, to the end,

00:13:50.050 --> 00:13:51.260
because I love him!

00:13:52.550 --> 00:13:55.300
I'm the same as you,

00:13:57.240 --> 00:14:01.010
but I can't let myself be broken here again.

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:05.710
Please, remember,

00:14:06.460 --> 00:14:08.890
the warm feelings of our master,

00:14:09.520 --> 00:14:11.450
and everyone waiting for us at the citadel!

00:14:39.080 --> 00:14:40.830
Okita-kun?

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:45.070
What is the thing you must do?

00:14:47.090 --> 00:14:52.840
I want to be stronger like you, 
because I admire you, Okita-kun.

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:55.810
For what reason?

00:14:55.810 --> 00:14:57.360
In order to protect things!

00:14:58.090 --> 00:15:02.960
I have a master waiting for 
me in a precious place.

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:04.830
Is that so?

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:07.740
Then you know what you need to do.

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:09.520
Yes.

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:11.730
It's strange.

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:14.870
It feels like this isn't 
the first time we've met.

00:15:15.580 --> 00:15:17.790
As if we were old friends.

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:24.880
I will wield my sword until this illness 
claims me, for loyalty and my comrades.

00:15:25.410 --> 00:15:27.810
That is the fate I have been given.

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:36.490
Sincerity

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:32.940
Finish doing what you need 
to do with that sword.

00:15:58.420 --> 00:15:59.780
Kiyomitsu.

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:02.000
Let's go home...

00:16:04.370 --> 00:16:06.120
To our citadel.

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:23.580
<b>Ikeda Inn</b>

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:24.720
Souji?

00:16:34.150 --> 00:16:36.670
I am Izuminokami Kanesada!

00:16:37.650 --> 00:16:41.030
To be completely devoted 
to practicality is unattractive,

00:16:41.030 --> 00:16:44.250
and it's stupid to just
 focus on appearances.

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:47.190
Thus, I combine both of those points.

00:16:47.660 --> 00:16:48.930
Isn't that right?

00:16:48.930 --> 00:16:49.810
Yes!

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:56.020
I wouldn't look cool if I was insincere!

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:58.710
So why don't we get this going?

00:17:03.420 --> 00:17:04.580
Kane-san!

00:17:30.180 --> 00:17:31.360
You guys...

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:50.420
<b>December</b>

00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:45.380
Master,

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:48.420
I have something I wish to discuss with you.

00:17:49.290 --> 00:17:50.380
Is now a good time?

00:17:58.390 --> 00:18:00.020
You're really going.

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:01.560
Yeah.

00:18:02.270 --> 00:18:03.380
Where to?

00:18:04.140 --> 00:18:05.280
I haven't decided yet.

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:06.550
When will you be back?

00:18:07.630 --> 00:18:08.770
I don't know that, either.

00:18:09.320 --> 00:18:10.260
I see.

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:12.930
So I'll be waiting for you again, then?

00:18:13.950 --> 00:18:17.940
This is probably what Master was going 
for when they sent you to the Ikeda Inn.

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:18.820
Huh?

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:21.400
You said you wanted to be stronger,

00:18:22.710 --> 00:18:25.190
so get stronger and come home.

00:18:26.530 --> 00:18:27.240
Okay.

00:18:38.180 --> 00:18:41.350
This is the very definition of elegance.

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:43.030
It feels nice.

00:18:43.870 --> 00:18:48.160
I had called this the thousand leaf 
cherry tree, but it appears I was wrong.

00:18:48.170 --> 00:18:49.340
No.

00:18:49.340 --> 00:18:53.850
The cherry blossoms said to bloom once in 
10,000 years have bloomed many times.

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:56.340
It's a miracle.

00:18:56.340 --> 00:18:58.150
They bloomed in the winter, as well.

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:00.020
No one understands...

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:03.080
...this tree.

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:05.750
But, that's what makes it interesting.

00:19:06.150 --> 00:19:08.550
That's the good thing about this tree.

00:19:09.020 --> 00:19:10.150
You're right.

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:14.340
It's as if this tree is watching over us.

00:19:14.340 --> 00:19:16.510
It makes me feel calm.

00:19:17.990 --> 00:19:19.110
You're right.

00:19:19.580 --> 00:19:25.210
This citadel is very lucky to be watched 
over by this tree and our master.

00:19:25.960 --> 00:19:27.300
Are you done yet?

00:19:27.300 --> 00:19:29.850
Pretty sure everyone is tired of waiting.

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:32.150
Just a minute.

00:19:32.490 --> 00:19:34.740
It's been a while since I've seen everyone

00:19:37.770 --> 00:19:38.620
Here.

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:41.840
You fixed it!

00:19:42.550 --> 00:19:45.460
I had lots of free time while you were gone.

00:19:45.460 --> 00:19:46.780
I decorated it.

00:19:52.300 --> 00:19:53.820
Thanks for waiting!

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:56.370
Yamatonokami!

00:19:56.370 --> 00:19:58.130
Y-Yamatonokami-san!

00:19:58.780 --> 00:20:00.080
I'm back!

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:02.070
It took you a while to get back!

00:20:02.640 --> 00:20:04.010
Welcome back!

00:20:04.410 --> 00:20:06.570
You seem better now.

00:20:06.980 --> 00:20:07.800
Yeah.

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:11.560
I am Yamatonokami Yasusada.

00:20:12.090 --> 00:20:15.360
I've shaken off my past and am the 
beloved sword of my current master.

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:18.820
I will fulfill my duties for my master.

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:22.100
Because that's what I have to do.

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:27.020
Hey, Yamatonokami, hurry 
up and get over here!

00:20:27.360 --> 00:20:28.620
One second.

00:20:31.170 --> 00:20:32.720
Please continue to look after me.

00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:41.610
Oh, the cherry blossoms answered you.

00:20:44.290 --> 00:20:47.520
Okay, is everyone here now?

00:20:47.520 --> 00:20:50.030
Get together in front of the tree.

00:20:50.030 --> 00:20:52.450
Why are we taking a picture?

00:20:52.450 --> 00:20:55.250
Because the cherry blossoms 
are beautiful, of course. Right?

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:57.970
This is why!

00:20:57.970 --> 00:21:01.200
Master bought me a camera.

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:03.350
It's called a SLR camera!

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:06.840
Master...

00:21:07.860 --> 00:21:10.510
Squish into the center a bit more!

00:21:11.230 --> 00:21:13.590
Ootachi, get further back!

00:21:13.590 --> 00:21:16.010
Ah, except Hotarumaru. He can be in the front.

00:21:16.010 --> 00:21:16.900
Okay.

00:21:16.900 --> 00:21:20.080
Okay, okay, the star sits in the center.

00:21:20.080 --> 00:21:21.750
We're all set.

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:23.990
I'm getting in the picture, too.

00:21:23.990 --> 00:21:26.080
Be sure and smile, everyone!

00:21:34.980 --> 00:21:41.190
April, in front of the large tree.

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:41.190
July, Maeda

00:21:44.210 --> 00:21:48.210
Hey, isn't this just a bit too cutesy?

00:21:48.210 --> 00:21:50.220
It's fine, isn't it?

00:21:50.220 --> 00:21:51.830
I think it suits you.

00:21:51.840 --> 00:21:53.800
You think so?

00:21:54.350 --> 00:21:57.870
Master won't be able to cherish 
you unless you're cute.

00:22:10.310 --> 00:22:12.650
Isn't it a little too flashy?

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:50.730
"This anime <i>was</i> about the 
stories of the Hanamaru days

00:23:50.730 --> 00:23:54.310
of a certain group of Sword 
